Maxie: Fufufu...{be01}
I commend you. I must recognize that
you are truly gifted.{be01}
But!
I have this in my possession!{be01}
With this Blue Orb, I can make
Groudon...

Maxie: Ah, whatever.
I will give up our plans for Mt. Chimney{be00}
for the time being...{be01}
But no one can ever stop us!
Team Magma will prevail!{be01}
Don’t you ever forget that!

Ahahahaha!{be01}
You’re going to meddle in Team Magma’s
affairs?{be01}
You’re either absolutely fearless,
simply ignorant, or both!{be01}
You’re so cute, you’re disgusting!
I’ll put you down, kiddy!{be01}

Ahahahaha!
We got meddled with unexpectedly!{be01}
We’re out of options.
We’ll have to pull out.{be01}
But this isn’t the last you’ll see of
Team Magma! We have other plans!{be00}
Don’t you forget it!

Ahahahaha!{be01}
How did you manage to get here without
a submarine?{be00}
What an impressive child!{be01}
But... It won’t do to have you
meddling about here.{be01}
And, I do want payback for what
happened at the Weather Institute...{be01}
I’m going to give you a little taste
of pain! Resign yourself to it!{be01}

Ahahahaha!
You’re so darn strong.{be01}
It’s terribly disappointing that you’re
not a Team Magma member.{be01}
You could have enjoyed the fabulous
world our Boss has promised to one{be00}
of our own...

We of Team Magma are working hard for
everyone’s sake.{be01}
Like, if there’s more land, there’d be
more places to live.{be00}
Everyone’d be happy!{be01}

This is plain not right...{be01}
The Boss told me this would be a
slick-and-easy job to pull.{be01}
All I had to do was steal some package
from Devon.{be01}
Tch!
You want it back that badly, take it!

The Boss got interested in the
research they have going here, so he{be00}
sent us out.{be01}
You quit meddling!{be01}

Our Hideout’s secret?{be01}
Well, let’s just say...
There’s a submarine at the far end!{be01}
But, by now...
Kekekeke...

Warp panels, the Hideout’s pride
and joy!{be01}
You’re clueless about where you are,
aren’t you?{be01}
Fluster and tire out the enemy, then
lower the boom! That’s our plan!{be01}

