Hehehe!{be01}
Our Boss has already gone on his way to
some cave under the sea!{be01}
If you’re going to give chase, you’d
better search the big, wide sea beyond{be00}
Lilycove.{be01}
But will you find it then?
Hehehe!

Hehehe!{be01}
